<title>CHILE: SOCCER-ATLETICO THROUGH WITH THREE-GOAL BURST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ATLETICO THROUGH WITH THREE-GOAL BURST.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO, Spain 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Holders Atletico Madrid sealed a Spanish Cup quarter-final place after scoring three times in the opening 20 minutes of their fourth round, second leg at Compostela on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Atletico won 3-2 on the night -- 5-2 on aggregate -- with goals from Juan Lopez, Kiko Narvaez and Leonardo Biagini. Former Atletico striker Lyuboslav Penev struck both Compostela goals, one from a penalty.</p>
